{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putt Down is a first person mini-golf horror. The game takes place in the same\u00a0universe as Gone Golfing, but instead of a putter you have a shotgun and it will be your go to problem solver. It can be used as putter or as a regular firearm. But this shotgun is a fragile tool, the more you use it the less\u00a0reliable it will get. You will need to score points and collect coins so you can repair you gun to keep it in good condition, because if you don't it will start to misfire when you least want it to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/9845f670495b746a4c1b5bc7469a0e4e.poster.avif?t=1770674867\" width=690 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/9845f670495b746a4c1b5bc7469a0e4e.webm?t=1770674867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/9845f670495b746a4c1b5bc7469a0e4e.mp4?t=1770674867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Max Fairway, a highly neurotic man with a nicotine addiction and a history of terrible life choices. After racking up a massive amount of gambling debt, the people you owe are finally coming to collect. Just as you're about to skip town, you're kidnapped by a mysterious stranger who makes you a bizarre offer, one you simply can't refuse. Now you are stuck in a mini-golf nightmare and the only way to clear your debt is to finish the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/7fca62e0896179d8beeabba3a7a558e9.poster.avif?t=1770674867\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/7fca62e0896179d8beeabba3a7a558e9.webm?t=1770674867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/7fca62e0896179d8beeabba3a7a558e9.mp4?t=1770674867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay consist of trying to survive while playing mini-golf with a shotgun. You will have to manage weapon degradation and panic levels with different items. All golf obstacles are random and will also face random events tied to each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/d70873a5bc5174001c2cbfe0beef0192.poster.avif?t=1770674867\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/d70873a5bc5174001c2cbfe0beef0192.webm?t=1770674867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/d70873a5bc5174001c2cbfe0beef0192.mp4?t=1770674867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics Based Golfing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golfing with a shotgun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survival Horror with stress system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Managing equipment status and weapon degradation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomized golf courses and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on gone golfing</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622010?t=1770674867","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622010?t=1770674867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/26d3c05ced71b30dbf8fa5f78b69083764836bc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770674867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/26d3c05ced71b30dbf8fa5f78b69083764836bc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770674867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3715340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Putt Down is a first person mini-golf horror. The game takes place in the same\u00a0universe as Gone Golfing, but instead of a putter you have a shotgun and it will be your go to problem solver. It can be used as putter or as a regular firearm. But this shotgun is a fragile tool, the more you use it the less\u00a0reliable it will get. You will need to score points and collect coins so you can repair you gun to keep it in good condition, because if you don't it will start to misfire when you least want it to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622010/extras/9845f670495b746a4c1b5bc7469a0e4e.poster.avif?t=1770674867\" width=690 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.